  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 1602.26 Modify",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 1602.26 “Modify” means change to any aspect of the operation or any process at a septage site or facility in a manner that has the potential to impact human health, groundwater, or the environment.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Env-Wq 1600) #13944, eff 4-27-24",
